<description>&lt;p&gt;City councils in Juba are now collecting over 600 tonnes of waste daily, most from Thongpiny, while road repairs and speed-bump installations are slated to begin within a week. The government is preparing climate-justice submissions to the African Court and addressing food insecurity worsened by El Niño and prolonged dry spells across parts of the country. President Kiir has posthumously promoted General Joseph Lagu to full General and the caretaker finance minister has pledged financial reforms as the UK reaffirms support. Machar said he took steps to prevent violence in Nasir and Ulang after fishing-net disputes sparked clashes, and a Kenyan preacher who urged followers to starve to death was sentenced to 200 years in prison. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNZ1BSWHJMaG1uRFFnYU5TUUIwMS14bzlFVkxuR21razB5d2Ytc3pkckhNWWNXQjI5OW15OTkwZnFVd0tULXdCS3RIVTNiX1doSTZTNVRTMWFwYkdNWHp2dXhURUFWTTJGNUNlR3NNb2hrUXE5b1puWjV6MnVQdnp0d2V3akhWdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;People Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNZEhBTlJnSmdvay1MYy00NUpjU29UbnowN0drZEsyYkFPNWY0M3BqQVNQbnJzYURXV2JHY282c1ZETEFmb244azVFeUVIMFlRQ013bzNCSnZWWW5iR01fZWVCNGZRejF4OTBPNks4aktpOEZHVF9MTG5ZempSVDVFTGxOUjN4TGw5eVFuQ1pQS1pkZzRwUHc0Nmd0NmM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudans Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a h